{\tc\tcl2 \v DirectX Tool Kit for DirectX 12}
{\f2 http://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=615561}\par
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.\par
{\b June 4, 2024} \par
This package contains the "DirectX Tool Kit", a collection of helper classes for writing Direct3D 12 C++ code for Universal Windows Platform (UWP) apps for Windows 11 and Windows 10, game titles for Xbox Series X|S and Xbox One, and Win32 desktop applications for Windows 11 and Windows 10.\par
This code is designed to build with Visual Studio 2019 (16.11), Visual Studio 2022, clang for Windows v12 or later, or MinGW 12.2. Use of the Windows 10 May 2020 Update SDK ({\f2 19041}) or later is required for Visual Studio.\par
These components are designed to work without requiring any content from the legacy {\b DirectX} SDK. For details, see {\f2 Where is the DirectX SDK?}.\par
